# Purpose

This document defines the notification engineering standards for the hubIO platform.

Its purpose is to establish consistent principles for communicating meaningful business events to users while preserving operational awareness, reducing unnecessary interruptions, and supporting effective business workflows.

---

# Scope

This standard defines:

* Notification philosophy
* Business communication
* Event-driven communication
* Delivery consistency
* Notification governance
* Communication evolution

It intentionally excludes delivery channels, messaging providers, templates, transport technologies, and implementation-specific notification mechanisms, which are defined by their respective Engineering Standards.

---

# Constitutional Interpretation

This document extends the hubIO Engineering Constitution.

It applies constitutional engineering principles to business communication, ensuring operational events are delivered consistently while preserving business context and user confidence.

